{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/AlphaResponse_Logo.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>From Gooseman, the legendary creator of the original Counter-Strike mod, comes Alpha Response - an adrenaline-fueled singleplayer/co-op experience that puts you in the boots of elite police forces worldwide.<br>Respond to critical situations requiring surgical precision to save innocent lives. Every decision matters in a world where threats lurk around every corner. Bring justice to chaos!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_EliteForces.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>Join a global police initiative battling cross-border criminal syndicates. Choose your elite unit and take the fight to the enemy.<br>Team up with 3 friends in explosive 4-player co-op or take on the challenge solo. Coordination is key - your survival depends on it.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/PlayAsElitePolice.gif?t=1748620717\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_NonLinear_Missions.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>Alpha Response features heart-racing dynamic missions from hostage rescues to bomb threats with multiple tactical approaches. Enemies spawn differently each time - no two operations are ever the same. Adapt or die, no two missions are ever the same<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/DynamicMissions.gif?t=1748620717\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_Dynamic_OpenLevels.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>Fight across massive, detailed environments from city streets and massive metro stations to towering cathedrals and industrial complexes. Navigate indoor and outdoor battlegrounds teeming with civilians who need your protection.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/OpenWorldLevel.gif?t=1748620717\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_EnemyVariety.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>Face a lethal variety of opponents - hardened criminals, attack dogs, armored vehicles, and helicopter gunships. Each threat demands unique tactics to overcome.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/EnemyVariety.gif?t=1748620717\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_WeaponArsenal.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>Dominate with an extensive arsenal from sidearms to heavy weaponry. Deploy shields, grenades, and vehicles to gain the tactical edge. Every tool is essential for mission success.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/WeaponVariety.gif?t=1748620717\" />","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2089250?t=1748620717","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748620717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/5269f02ebf929db071c696ad3ec8a6f9f71732ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748620717","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/5269f02ebf929db071c696ad3ec8a6f9f71732ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748620717","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Players will play as police and will be killing criminal gangsters and terrorists.\r\n\r\nThere will be civilians in the game but players are not encouraged to harm them. They must protect them and will be penalized in the game if they hurt any civilians"},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/RoadMap.png?t=1748620717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graphical Improvements to the various environments and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Performance Improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adding more missions bringing the total number of unique missions to over 40!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adding new enemy types such as flying drones that can attack the player from the air</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adding teammate AI that will allow players who play singleplayer to control a squad of AI controlled police.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/AlphaResponse_Logo.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>From Gooseman, the legendary creator of the original Counter-Strike mod, comes Alpha Response - an adrenaline-fueled singleplayer/co-op experience that puts you in the boots of elite police forces worldwide.<br>Respond to critical situations requiring surgical precision to save innocent lives. Every decision matters in a world where threats lurk around every corner. Bring justice to chaos!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_EliteForces.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>Join a global police initiative battling cross-border criminal syndicates. Choose your elite unit and take the fight to the enemy.<br>Team up with 3 friends in explosive 4-player co-op or take on the challenge solo. Coordination is key - your survival depends on it.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/PlayAsElitePolice.gif?t=1748620717\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_NonLinear_Missions.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>Alpha Response features heart-racing dynamic missions from hostage rescues to bomb threats with multiple tactical approaches. Enemies spawn differently each time - no two operations are ever the same. Adapt or die, no two missions are ever the same<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/DynamicMissions.gif?t=1748620717\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_Dynamic_OpenLevels.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>Fight across massive, detailed environments from city streets and massive metro stations to towering cathedrals and industrial complexes. Navigate indoor and outdoor battlegrounds teeming with civilians who need your protection.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/OpenWorldLevel.gif?t=1748620717\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_EnemyVariety.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>Face a lethal variety of opponents - hardened criminals, attack dogs, armored vehicles, and helicopter gunships. Each threat demands unique tactics to overcome.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/EnemyVariety.gif?t=1748620717\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/TopicHeadline_WeaponArsenal.png?t=1748620717\" /><br>Dominate with an extensive arsenal from sidearms to heavy weaponry. Deploy shields, grenades, and vehicles to gain the tactical edge. Every tool is essential for mission success.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/extras/WeaponVariety.gif?t=1748620717\" />","developers":["Ultimo Ratio Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/b73d3464b9832687c982356a3640594f1483a52b/header.jpg?t=1748620717","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92024 Ultimo Ratio Games Inc. Alpha Response is developed by Ultimo Ratio Games Inc. Alpha Response and its logo are trademarks or registered trademarks of Ultimo Ratio Games Inc. All other trademarks or registered trademarks belong to their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257142932,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142932/movie480.mp4?t=1747885014","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142932/movie_max.mp4?t=1747885014"},"name":"Alpha Response Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142932/7a94a6abf1157f5b965537d9489b8a15c9cf6426/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747885014","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142932/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747885014","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr