ns into a full-blown blockbuster affair. Bullets screaming across the screen, all while trying to revive one of our downed partners, is hectic in all the right ways.\u201d<br>Vice<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/9cafd2de78c9ce240c43b9a0589f6d08fc338cf7/ss_9cafd2de78c9ce240c43b9a0589f6d08fc338cf7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748620717","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/9cafd2de78c9ce240c43b9a0589f6d08fc338cf7/ss_9cafd2de78c9ce240c43b9a0589f6d08fc338cf7.600x338.jpg?t=1748620717"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/7356bac7cc3164c8457b4c321d69e6b1fb78ef2a/ss_7356bac7cc3164c8457b4c321d69e6b1fb78ef2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748620717","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/7356bac7cc3164c8457b4c321d69e6b1fb78ef2a/ss_7356bac7cc3164c8457b4c321d69e6b1fb78ef2a.600x338.jpg?t=1748620717"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/b568119b14b2abbd3670b8352a24aff89628deb9/ss_b568119b14b2abbd3670b8352a24aff89628deb9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748620717","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/b568119b14b2abbd3670b8352a24aff89628deb9/ss_b568119b14b2abbd3670b8352a24aff89628deb9.600x338.jpg?t=1748620717"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/3e16f3702c9eefe7bd4a857616b5442edb282ab8/ss_3e16f3702c9eefe7bd4a857616b5442edb282ab8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748620717","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/3e16f3702c9eefe7bd4a857616b5442edb282ab8/ss_3e16f3702c9eefe7bd4a857616b5442edb282ab8.600x338.jpg?t=1748620717"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089250/788946694508c97e76e40e1b3da4c0f0ce00e272/ss_7889